# === GT Factory OS PRODUCTION workspace ===
# Phase 7 cleanup baseline (2026-05-08).
#
# Tracks:
#   - authority docs (CLAUDE.md, CURRENT_STATE.md, EXECUTION_POLICY.md,
#     WORKSPACE_MAP.md, ACTIVE_NOW.md)
#   - .claude/ AI brain (agents, hooks, settings, mcp.json, state, README, SIGNALS)
#   - archive/ (history-only reference; excluding large binary duplicates)
#   - data/ (operational reference; structure + READMEs only — binaries ignored)
#   - docs/ (operational workspace)
#
# Ignores: rotating output, vendored binaries, large reference data files.
# See WORKSPACE_MAP.md for the canonical layout this represents.

# --- Rotating output directories ---
.audit-tmp/
.audits/*
!.audits/RETENTION_POLICY.md
.lionwheel-prints/
.superpowers/

# --- Vendored binaries ---
.tools/

# --- Reference data files (large binaries; structure + READMEs tracked, content not) ---
data/excel/active/*.xls*
data/excel/backups/
data/excel/temp-locks/
data/json/shopify/*.json
data/invoices/suppliers/**/*.pdf
data/invoices/suppliers/**/*.jpg
data/invoices/suppliers/**/*.jpeg
data/invoices/suppliers/**/*.png

# --- Archive: historical binaries duplicated under data/ ---
archive/migrated-to-data/**/*.jpg
archive/migrated-to-data/**/*.jpeg
archive/migrated-to-data/**/*.pdf
archive/migrated-to-data/**/*.png
archive/migrated-to-data/**/_resized/

# --- OS noise ---
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
~$*

# --- Editor noise ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo

# --- Node / build artifacts (defensive; PRODUCTION should not host code) ---
node_modules/
dist/
build/
# cavekit spec-driven-dev skill — tooling, not a build artifact (Tom-approved 2026-06-19)
!.claude/skills/build/
.next/

# --- Defensive: secrets / credentials must never land in PRODUCTION git ---
# (also enforced by .claude/settings.json deny rules and pre_tool_use.sh hook)
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets/
credentials/
*.pem
*.key
.aws/
.ssh/
